ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, Partial Nudity"},"detailed_description":"<h1>Pre-order bonus</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/extras/bc1e6a937de8c979c63a353ce73f723c.avif?t=1767948787\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>- Hellfire Equipment Set (Hellfire Warrior Armor set + Hellfire Ninja Attire set)<br>- Scampuss Furball Netsuke Charm (accessory)<br><br>Note: Please be aware that bonuses may become available for purchase or for free as add-on content for this title at a later date.</p><br><h1>Early purchase bonus</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/extras/a952d6066f01679dcb7d453e63f0c9ea.avif?t=1767948787\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>- Hellfrost Equipment Set (Hellfrost Warrior Armor set + Hellfrost Ninja Attire set)<br>- Hellfrost Ninja Attire (set)<br><br>Note:<br>- The early purchase bonus will be available for those who purchase the game by February 19, 2026.<br>- Please be aware that bonuses may become available for purchase or for free as add-on content for this title at a later date.</p><br><h1>Digital Deluxe Edition Content</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/extras/951a9270c457592a9c247ad4d0bd6ef2.avif?t=1767948787\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>This edition includes the following content:<br>- &quot;Nioh 3&quot; base game<br>- &quot;Nioh 3&quot; season pass<br>- &quot;Nioh 3&quot; season pass bonus &quot;Chijiko Netsuke Charm&quot; (accessory)<br><br>Digital Deluxe Edition bonus:<br>- Infernal Weapons Set (14 types)<br>- Kodama Netsuke Charm (accessory)<br><br>Note:<br>- The season pass is a set including add-on DLC. The DLC include new stories, enemies, yokai, boss characters, and equipment.<br>- The player must progress to certain points in game to make the season pass content available.<br>- Please be aware that bonuses may become available for purchase or for free as add-on content for this title at a later date. <br>- The details and release dates of content may change without notice.<br>- The season pass bonus will be released on the same date as the base game. Add-on DLC 1 is set to become available by the end of September 2026, and add-on DLC 2 is set to become available by the end of February 2027.<br><br>Please see the official site for more details.<br><br>- The standard edition of &quot;Nioh 3&quot; is also being sold. Please confirm that you have selected the correct product before making your purchase.<br>- The base game and season pass are included in this product. Please be careful not to make duplicate purchases.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Conquer the Crucible, Become Shogun</strong><br><br>&quot;Nioh 3&quot; is the latest game in the dark samurai action RPG series.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Elements of the Game:<br>\u2022 An open field that challenges you to the fullest</h2>This game features an open field filled with the sense of tension characteristic of the &quot;Nioh&quot; series while also allowing you to explore to your heart's content. In this dark samurai world, you will encounter formidable yokai, explore menacing villages where darkness lurks, and struggle against the ominous presence of &quot;the Crucible.&quot;<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/extras/a0d1ffdf4778b0dfa7d3b25d2c12024e.poster.avif?t=1767948787\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/extras/a0d1ffdf4778b0dfa7d3b25d2c12024e.webm?t=1767948787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/extras/a0d1ffdf4778b0dfa7d3b25d2c12024e.mp4?t=1767948787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Samurai and Ninja combat styles</h2>You can enjoy an instantaneous and seamless switch between two combat styles during battle, facing your enemies head-on with Samurai Style and using quick movements and special techniques with Ninja Style.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/extras/e18e03b8ed23aef215c81e44885517c6.poster.avif?t=1767948787\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/extras/e18e03b8ed23aef215c81e44885517c6.webm?t=1767948787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/extras/e18e03b8ed23aef215c81e44885517c6.mp4?t=1767948787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br>Note: The product &quot;Nioh 3 Digital Deluxe Edition&quot; is also being sold. Please confirm that you have selected the correct product before making your purchase.<br>Note: These images are taken from an in-development build of the game. The final version may differ.","developers":["KOEI TECMO GAMES CO., LTD."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/a21264e9fd476dcb2901c2432b598107d024c5a8/header.jpg?t=1767948787","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9KOEI TECMO GAMES CO., LTD. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong>